ata-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
